{:adr/id "2607121800"
 :adr/title "network-isekai small-scale AAA/Nintendo-quality roadmap: level design, art direction, character/texture pipeline"
 :adr/status :accepted
 :adr/date "2026-07-12"
 :adr/related ["2607120100-kami-engine-cljs-direct-webgpu-rendering-standard"
               "2607022340-kami-isekai-assets-template-lib"]

 :gap "three quality-relevant building blocks already exist but are disconnected/unused: (1) kami.webgpu.mesh (real mesh+skin+texture, live in isekai.stage.cljc's VRM dance avatars + kami-app-character-creator) is never wired into kami.webgpu (the procedural-primitive-only executor every top-down game actually renders through); (2) kotoba.level (spawns/zone/objective) is on network-isekai's own classpath and royale's default-level is literally named for it, but no game requires it -- level layout everywhere is hardcoded f32 constants in logic.cljc; (3) art direction is raw uncomposed per-scene RGB with no reusable named-preset unit, despite kami-engine (different domain: CAD/vehicle-sim) already proving this pattern (postfx.edn named mood presets incl. :nintendo, biomes.edn named biome presets) and an accepted-but-unbuilt ADR (2607022340, kami.isekai.palette) for exactly this in network-isekai's own domain."

 :decision "3-phase roadmap, ascending cost/risk, each independently shippable. Phase 1 (this pass): wire kotoba.level's zone into royale, host-side only (mirrors the existing :platformer config pattern in kotoba.host/tick! -- no guest/logic.cljc change). Phase 2 (this pass): new src/isekai/art_presets.cljc, in-repo-first named preset map (postfx.edn/biomes.edn-shaped) merged as a base layer under scene.edn's own :render/sky/:render/profiles via isekai.render-ir's scene->globals/scene->materials; first consumer extracts at6-texan's current palette losslessly into :iyashikei-coast. Phase 3 (deferred, NOT implemented this pass): unify kami.webgpu.mesh into the render-IR pipeline so :render/profiles can reference a real :mesh asset instead of only procedural :geo, two-pass-per-frame (loadOp:\"load\") exactly as isekai.stage.cljc already proves for VRM avatars. Flagship: goriketsu (player+gorilla). Blocked on sourcing an actual test character asset -- not code-only."

 :phase1 {:target "gftdcojp/network-isekai: public/games/gftd/royale/scene.edn + src/isekai/game.cljc"
          :mechanism "host reads scene :level (kotoba.level schema) each tick, computes zone-radius, renders it as one more render-IR instance (thin ring, existing procedural path), despawns out-of-zone \"bot\" entities directly on the host ECS atom -- zero guest wasm change"}

 :phase2 {:target "gftdcojp/network-isekai: new src/isekai/art_presets.cljc + src/isekai/render_ir.cljc + public/games/gftd/at6-texan/scene.edn"
          :mechanism "named preset (:render/sky + :render/profiles bundle) as a merge-base under scene.edn's own overrides; first preset :iyashikei-coast extracted losslessly from at6-texan's current values"
          :deferred "promoting into a 5th Asset Hub asset kind (:art-preset, content-addressed) -- explicit follow-up, not done until >1 preset exists"}

 :phase3 {:target "kotoba-lang/webgpu (render-IR contract) + kotoba-lang/org-vrmc-vrm (texture extraction) + gftdcojp/network-isekai (game.cljc dual-pass draw)"
          :flagship "goriketsu (player + gorilla)"
          :blockers ["org-vrmc-vrm texture extraction is baseColor-only today (no normal/metallic-roughness/occlusion/emissive)"
                     "no test character glTF/VRM asset exists yet -- sourcing/authoring one is a prerequisite, not code"]
          :status :designed-not-implemented}

 :verification {:phase1 "royale loaded in a real browser: shrinking zone ring renders and visibly shrinks over time, bots straying outside despawn, no console/status errors"
                :phase2 "at6-texan loaded before/after the preset extraction: screenshot comparison confirms sky/material colors unchanged"}

 :follow-up ["promote art_presets.cljc presets to a first-class Asset Hub kind once >1 preset exists"
             "extend org-vrmc-vrm texture extraction beyond baseColor ahead of/during Phase 3"
             "source or author a first test character asset for goriketsu before Phase 3 code work starts"]}
